--- a/docs/rules/no-dupe-disjunctions.md
+++ b/docs/rules/no-dupe-disjunctions.md
@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@ since: "v0.4.0"
 
 This rule disallows duplicate disjunctions.
 
+It also reports removable alternatives inside nested groups and individual elements of non-negated character classes. Redundant range endpoints can be removed by shortening the range. Prefix coverage follows matching order, the surrounding pattern, and the `reportUnreachable` option.
+
